<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - EmpPortal</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.2.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4f46e5;
            --bg-color: #f1f5f9;
            --text-main: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navbar */
        nav {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 1rem 5%;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* About Section */
        .about-hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .about-hero p {
            opacity: 0.9;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 10px auto 0;
        }

        .main-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: -50px auto 50px;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .content-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Grid for Features */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .feature-item {
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .feature-item i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature-item h4 {
            margin: 10px 0 5px;
        }

        .feature-item p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav>
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <i class="ri-shield-user-line"></i> EmpPortal
        </a>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/form/allEmp">Directory</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" style="color: var(--primary);">About</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="about-hero">
        <h1>About the System</h1>
        <p>A modern solution for managing your workforce with ease and precision.</p>
    </section>

    <main class="main-container">
        <div class="content-card">
            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="ri-rocket-2-line"></i> Our Mission
            </div>
            <p>
                EmpPortal is designed to simplify human resource management. Whether you're a small startup or a growing
                company, our tool helps you keep track of your most valuable asset—your employees.
            </p>

            <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 40px 0;">

            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="ri-focus-3-line"></i> Key Features
            </div>

            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <i class="ri-database-2-line"></i>
                    <h4>Centralized Data</h4>
                    <p>All employee records in one secure place.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <i class="ri-search-eye-line"></i>
                    <h4>Quick Search</h4>
                    <p>Find any team member within seconds.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <i class="ri-edit-box-line"></i>
                    <h4>Easy Updates</h4>
                    <p>Modify details with a user-friendly interface.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <i class="ri-lock-password-line"></i>
                    <h4>Secure Access</h4>
                    <p>Your data is protected and kept private.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">Built with ❤️ by <b>Sujal Kidecha</b></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2025 EmpPortal System | Version 1.0.0
    </footer>

</body>

</html>